<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Software Recommendation Methodology | TechSelectAI</title><meta name="description" content="See how TechSelectAI scores software recommendations, separates fit from evidence confidence, treats unknowns, and keeps sponsorship outside ranking."><link rel="canonical" href="https://techselectai.com/methodology"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><meta property="og:title" content="Software Recommendation Methodology | TechSelectAI"><meta property="og:description" content="How TechSelectAI turns confirmed buyer requirements into explainable software recommendations."><meta property="og:url" content="https://techselectai.com/methodology"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"TechSelectAI Software Recommendation Methodology","url":"https://techselectai.com/methodology","description":"TechSelectAI deterministic recommendation methodology, evidence interpretation and ranking independence rules."}</script><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f7f9fc;color:#172033;line-height:1.65}.top{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px max(20px,5vw)}.top img{height:36px;width:auto}.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:42px 22px 64px}.hero,.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dde7ee;border-radius:18px;padding:26px}.hero h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.12;color:#1A365D;margin:8px 0 14px}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#319795}.lead{font-size:19px;color:#475569;max-width:790px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:20px}.card h2{font-size:21px;color:#1A365D;margin:0 0 10px}.weights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:8px 16px}.weights div{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7}.note{background:#eef8f7;border-left:4px solid #319795;padding:15px 17px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:16px}.links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.links a{display:inline-flex;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-decoration:none;color:#1A365D;background:#fff;font-weight:700}.links a.primary{background:#1A365D;color:#fff;border-color:#1A365D}.muted{color:#64748b;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:720px){.hero h1{font-size:34px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding-top:24px}}</style></head><body><header class="top"><a href="/" aria-label="TechSelectAI home"><img src="/techselectai-logo.svg" alt="TechSelectAI"></a></header><main class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Recommendation methodology</div><h1>Explainable recommendations, not hidden rankings.</h1><p class="lead">TechSelectAI converts confirmed buyer requirements into a deterministic Fit Score for curated categories. AI helps structure requirements and explain results, while the final curated ranking follows the published scoring model.</p><div class="links"><a class="primary" href="/">Start a consultation</a><a href="/trust">Trust & independence</a><a href="/software">Explore software</a></div></section><section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Fit Score weights</h2><div class="weights"><div>Functional Fit</div><strong>35%</strong><div>Must-Have Compliance</div><strong>20%</strong><div>Integration Fit</div><strong>10%</strong><div>Security & Compliance</div><strong>10%</strong><div>Deployment Fit</div><strong>10%</strong><div>Commercial Fit</div><strong>7%</strong><div>Regional Fit</div><strong>5%</strong><div>Implementation Fit</div><strong>3%</strong></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Capability support values</h2><div class="weights"><div>Supported</div><strong>1.00</strong><div>Enterprise only</div><strong>0.90</strong><div>Plan dependent</div><strong>0.80</strong><div>Custom configuration</div><strong>0.70</strong><div>Partially supported</div><strong>0.65</strong><div>Add-on</div><strong>0.60</strong><div>Third-party integration</div><strong>0.55</strong><div>Unknown / not yet verified</div><strong>0.40</strong><div>Not supported</div><strong>0.00</strong></div></article><article class="card"><h2>Requirement priority</h2><p>Confirmed buyer requirements are weighted by importance so a nice-to-have does not count the same as a must-have.</p><div class="weights"><div>Must-have</div><strong>5</strong><div>Important</div><strong>3</strong><div>Nice-to-have</div><strong>1</strong></div><div class="note"><strong>Unknown ≠ Not Supported.</strong> Missing evidence receives a conservative partial value rather than being treated as a confirmed failure.</div></article><article class="card"><h2>Fit and evidence stay separate</h2><p><strong>Fit Score</strong> answers: how well does this product match this buyer's confirmed requirements?</p><p><strong>Evidence Confidence</strong> answers: how strong and current is the evidence behind the claims used in the evaluation?</p><p class="muted">A high-fit product can still require further verification when evidence confidence is lower.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>AI's role</h2><p>AI may help interpret the business problem, structure requirements, ask follow-up questions, and explain the recommendation. In curated mode, AI does not secretly override the deterministic final ranking.</p><p>When TechSelectAI advises on a topic outside the curated catalog, it operates in general technology-consultant mode and does not fabricate TechSelectAI Fit Scores or curated evidence claims.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Sponsorship does not rank products</h2><p>Commercial relationships, featured placements, or ownership do not increase Fit Score, Evidence Confidence, or ranking position. Sponsored placements are labeled and kept outside the recommendation ranking.</p><p>TechSelectAI is operated by Barmageyat. Barmageyat-owned products, including CardIQ, are evaluated using the same methodology and evidence requirements as other products.</p></article></section></main></body></html>